ors in South Africa, other African countries, Europe, and internationally. It operates through Entyce Beverages, Snackworks, I&J, Personal Care, and Footwear and Apparel segments. The company provides tea, coffee, and creamer; out-of-home ranges; sweet and savoury biscuits; baked and fried potato, and maize snacks; personal care products, including body spray, fragrance, cosmetics, and body lotion products; footwear and apparel; and catches, processes, markets, and distributes seafood and farmed abalone. It offers beverages under the Five Roses, Freshpak, TRINCO, Ellis Brown, HOUSE OF COFFEES, Koffiehuis, ciro, LAVAZZA, and frisco brands; biscuits and snacks under the BAKERS, Willards, Baker Street, and PROVITA brands; frozen food under the I&J brand; and personal care products under the YARDLEY, Exclamation, and LENTHÉRIC brand names. The company also provides fashion products under the SPITZ, KURT GEIGER, LACOSTE, CARVELA, TOSONI, GANT, and Green Cross GX&Co brands. AVI Limited was incorporated in 1944 and is based in Johannesburg, South Africa.","employees":8680,"website":"https://www.avi.co.za","country":"South Africa","city":"Johannesburg","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Simon Leigh Crutchley BBusSci (UCT)","title":"CEO & Executive Director"},{"name":"Mr. Justin C. O'Meara","title":"CFO & Executive Director"},{"name":"Mr. Michael  Koursaris","title":"Acting MD of National Brands Limited, Business Development Director & Executive Director"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":10.2,"tpe":14.06,"ps":0.6416,"pfcf":16.56,"peg":null,"pb":1.807,"ev_ebitda":8.279,"rev_growth":0.014,"eps_growth":0.034,"eps_growth_fwd":0.0678,"eps_growth_next":0.0977,"div_yield":0.0548,"roe":0.1751,"roa":0.07046,"de":32.0,"gross_margin":0.3366,"op_margin":0.1151,"profit_margin":0.07351,"current_ratio":1.628},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":9.95,"sector":10.2,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":10.96,"sector":14.06,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price